/**
 * @defgroup MCC_Tuning Tuning
 * @ingroup MCC
 * @brief Frequencies of written pitches under an explicit tuning.
 *
 * `MCC::Tuning` fixes the frequency of one reference pitch (standard:
 * `A4 = 440 Hz`), and `MCC::EqualTemperament` derives the frequency of any
 * `MCC::Pitch` from it. This is the only MCC module that uses `float`
 * (SPEC-EMB-4); embedded builds that do not need frequencies can disable it
 * with `MCC_TUNING=OFF`. Requires the Pitch module.
 *
 * Available when `MCC_TUNING` is defined.
 */
